{"a1":[{"k":"title","cap":"Most Vowels in a Window","say":"Let's solve Most Vowels in a Window, using the Fixed Sliding Window approach.","card":{"title":"Most Vowels in a Window","sub":"Fixed Sliding Window · Medium","pattern":"sliding-window"}},{"k":"problem","cap":"Return the largest number of vowels (a, e, i, o, u) in any substring of s with length exactly k.","card":{"lines":["Return the largest number of vowels (a, e, i, o, u) in any substring of s with length exactly k."]}},{"k":"example","cap":"For example, with s = \"abciiidef\", k = 3, the answer is 3. \"iii\".","say":"For example, with s equals \"abciiidef\", k equals 3, the answer is 3. \"iii\".","card":{"lines":["Input: s = \"abciiidef\", k = 3","Output: 3","\"iii\"."]}},{"k":"idea","cap":"Add one if s[right] is a vowel. When the window grows past k, subtract one if s[left] was a vowel and move left. Keep the best count.","say":"Add one if s at right is a vowel. When the window grows past k, subtract one if s at left was a vowel and move left. Keep the best count.","card":{"pattern":"sliding-window","name":"Sliding Window"}},{"k":"trace","cap":"Let's walk through it with s = \"abciiidef\", k = 3.","say":"Let's walk through it with s equals \"abciiidef\", k equals 3.","st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'a' has 1 vowel. Best: 1.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'ab' has 1 vowel. Best: 1.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":1}],"w":[0,1]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'abc' has 1 vowel. Best: 1.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":2}],"w":[0,2]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'bci' has 1 vowel. Best: 1.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":1},{"l":"right","i":3}],"w":[1,3]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'cii' has 2 vowels. Best: 2.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":2},{"l":"right","i":4}],"w":[2,4]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"2"},{"k":"best","v":"2"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'iii' has 3 vowels. Best: 3.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":5}],"w":[3,5]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"3"},{"k":"best","v":"3"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'iid' has 2 vowels. Best: 3.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":4},{"l":"right","i":6}],"w":[4,6]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"2"},{"k":"best","v":"3"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'ide' has 2 vowels. Best: 3.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":5},{"l":"right","i":7}],"w":[5,7]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"2"},{"k":"best","v":"3"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'def' has 1 vowel. Best: 3.","ln":{"python":8,"java":8},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":6},{"l":"right","i":8}],"w":[6,8]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"3"}]}},{"k":"done","cap":"The answer is 3.","st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","i","i","i","d","e","f"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":6},{"l":"right","i":8}],"w":[6,8]}],"vars":[{"k":"count","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"3"}]}},{"k":"complexity","cap":"Time complexity is O(n) and extra space is O(1).","say":"Time complexity is O of n and extra space is O of one.","card":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"}},{"k":"outro","cap":"That's the Fixed Sliding Window approach. Now try writing it yourself, in Java or Python!"}]}